      "summary_en": "Viktor conjures an Arcane Storm on the field, dealing magic damage and interrupting enemy channels. The storm periodically does magic damage to all nearby enemies and can be redirected by Viktor. Augment: The Arcane Storm moves 25% faster, and whenever champions die after taking damage from it, the storm grows and increases in its duration.",
      "summary_zh": "维克托在场上召唤一道奥术风暴，对敌人造成魔法伤害并打断敌人的引导。之后风暴会周期性对附近所有敌人造成魔法伤害，且可以被维克托重新导向。 增强：奥术风暴的移动速度提升25%，每有英雄在受到风暴伤害后阵亡，风暴就会扩大，持续时间也会延长。",
